<title>TURKEY: Kurd rebel suicide bombing kills five in Turkey.</title>
<headline>Kurd rebel suicide bombing kills five in Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Kurdish rebel suicide bomber killed herself, three policemen and a civilian when she set off an explosive device in the central Turkish town of Sivas on Tuesday, police said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have three police martyrs,&quot; a police spokesman told Reuters. &quot;The female terrorist and a civilian also died,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
